[{"answer":"Jack, I'm thinking of taking the kids to the seaside on a surfing holiday this summer","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"and I wanted to ask your advice","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"as I know you're such an expert.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I don't know about that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"but yes, I've done a bit of surfing over the years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd thoroughly recommend it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it's the kind of holiday all the family can enjoy together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The thing about surfing is that it's great for all ages and all abilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"My youngest started when he was only three!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's quite physically demanding, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I've heard you need to be pretty fit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. You'll certainly learn more quickly and won't tire as easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well - that should be OK for us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"You've been surfing a few times in Ireland, haven't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"There's some great surfing there, which people don't always realise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And which locations would you recommend?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"There seem to be quite a few.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there are loads.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Last year we went to County Donegal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"There are several great places to surf there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"What about in County Clare?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I read that's also really good for surfing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been there a few times.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Most people go to Lahinch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"My kids love it there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"The waves aren't too challenging and the town is very lively.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there good hotels there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes - some very nice ones","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are also a few basic hostels and campsites.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's great if you need lessons as the surf schools are excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes and there's lots to see in the area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"like those well-known cliffs...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I've forgotten the name of them...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh don't worry - I can look them up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I've also been surfing in County Mayo,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"which is less well-known for surfing, but we had a really good time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"That was a few years ago when the kids were younger.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a good surf school at Carrowniskey beach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you spell that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Carrowniskey","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I put the kids into the surf camp they run during the summer for 10-16 year olds","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"How long was that for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Three hours every day for a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It was perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"They were so tired out after that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I can imagine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"One thing we did while the kids were surfing","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"was to rent some kayaks to have a look around the bay which is nearby.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"It's really beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I'd love to do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Now the only time I went to Ireland it rained practically every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that can be a problem,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but you can surf in the rain, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't have the same appeal, somehow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the weather's been fine the last couple of years when I've been there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"but actually, it tends to rain more in August than in the spring or autumn.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"September's my favourite month because the water is warmer then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"The only problem is that the kids are back to school then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"But one good thing about Irish summers is that it doesn't get too hot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/66.mp3"},{"answer":"The average temperature is about 19 degrees","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and it usually doesn't go above 25 degrees.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/68.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds alright.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what about costs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Surfing is a pretty cheap holiday really,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/71.mp3"},{"answer":"the only cost is the hire of equipment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/72.mp3"},{"answer":"You can expect to pay a daily rate of about 30 euros for the hire of a wetsuit and board,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/73.mp3"},{"answer":"but you can save about 40 euros if you hire by the week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That's not too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/75.mp3"},{"answer":"No.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/76.mp3"},{"answer":"It's important to make sure you get good quality wetsuits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/77.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll all get too cold if you don't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/78.mp3"},{"answer":"And make sure you also get boots.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/79.mp3"},{"answer":"They keep your feet warm and it's easier to surf with them on too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/80.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well, thanks very much...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-3-section-1-2022-12-24-21-56-42/81.mp3"}]
